<h2>Profile</h2>
<p class="profile">Architect and interior designer with seven years across Egypt and the Gulf. I design luxury homes, coastal developments and corporate headquarters, and carry them through approval to site; most are built or under construction. I have led teams of up to five, including the architectural BIM package for NEOM’s Misk Schools. Selected work for NEOM, SABIC, STC, SODIC, Orascom and Misr Italia.</p>
<h2>Core strengths</h2>
<div class="str">
<div><b>Coastal &amp; Luxury Residential</b>Ras El Hekma, Almaza Bay, El Gouna; SODIC, Orascom, Misr Italia.</div>
<div><b>Masterplans &amp; Communities</b>A community for ~7,000 residents; a 19-zone waterfront district in Oman.</div>
<div><b>Corporate HQs &amp; Interiors</b>SABIC, STC, Jotun, H.B. Fuller, BMW; three office interiors built.</div>
<div><b>Design to Construction</b>Led a team of five on a NEOM BIM package (LOD 300); code review and consultant coordination.</div>
</div>
<h2>Professional experience</h2>
<div class="job"><div><div class="yr">2026 — now</div><div class="role">Mid-senior Design Architect</div><div class="firm">Innovation Design Studio, Cairo</div></div>
<ul><li><b><a href="https://ayahassan.com/work/travco-west-island/">Travco West Island, Almaza Bay</a>:</b> sole designer of the four-unit chalet prototype and the townhome, from an empty plot to client approval — plans, elevations and 3D, oriented to the north wind and lagoon views. Under construction.</li>
<li><b><a href="https://ayahassan.com/work/sodic-east-vale/">SODIC East Vale, MADA City</a>:</b> designed the premium-home prototype of two stacked units, separating private quarters from reception and living. Under construction.</li>
<li><b><a href="https://ayahassan.com/work/staff-housing/">Staff Housing Community</a>:</b> led a team of three on a masterplan proposal for ~7,000 residents — clustered courtyards, a town-wide pedestrian network and two repeatable prototypes in a Nubian-inspired language.</li>
<li><b>SODIC Ogami &amp; Orascom O West:</b> massing and façade of new prototypes within each scheme’s established language; client presentations. Ogami under construction.</li>
<li><b><a href="https://ayahassan.com/work/misr-italia-hilltop/">Misr Italia Hilltop, Ras El Hekma</a>:</b> sole visualiser for three apartment prototypes; refined materials, details and façade along the way. Approved; under construction.</li>
<li>Introduced AI-assisted post-production into the studio’s visualisation workflow.</li></ul></div>
<div class="job"><div><div class="yr">2025</div><div class="role">Mid-senior Design Architect &amp; Interior Designer</div><div class="firm">Cosmos Studio, Cairo · rejoined</div></div>
<ul><li><b><a href="https://ayahassan.com/work/sallan-creek/">Sallan Creek (DHIFAF), Oman</a>:</b> turned a hand-sketched masterplan into an accurate 19-zone waterfront plan; district-wide 3D model, aerial renders and client presentation.</li>
<li><b>Chery Showroom, Linah Farms &amp; NOATUM Terminal:</b> concept through design development, with coordinated Revit BIM packages across the engineering disciplines; visuals, animation and client presentations.</li>
<li><b>Fifth Square:</b> canopy design; modelling and rendering of the whole complex.</li>
<li><b><a href="https://ayahassan.com/work/mazeej/">Mazeej Hotel &amp; Housing Complex</a>:</b> design review and redesign for building-code compliance.</li></ul></div>
